Package: mbp132-support
Version: 0.5.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, coreutils, git, ca-certificates, dkms, build-essential, linux-firmware, pciutils, usbutils, ethtool, network-manager, kmod, mokutil, systemd
Maintainer: MacBookPro13,2 community integration <maintainers@invalid.example>
Description: Beta support integration and kernel update monitor for 2016 T1 MacBook Pro
 Installs Apple T1 Touch Bar, Cirrus audio and BCM43602 Wi-Fi NVRAM from
 pinned community sources after explicit approval. Preserves a known-good
 Ubuntu kernel from autoremove, monitors DKMS on updates; cannot guarantee
 future kernel ABI compatibility. Intended for Ubuntu 26.04 LTS.
